2026-11-21 19:05:05,900 - kalpy.graphs - 134092083865280 - 1 - DEBUG - 1-7: and the dam was just below the where the two branches east and west branches of fever brook came together
2026-11-21 19:05:05,900 - kalpy.graphs - 134092083865280 - 1 - DEBUG - 1-70: oh the moor's7enus cowbrook is when there was an intersection and the big heroic found the othergov
2026-11-21 19:05:05,900 - kalpy.graphs - 134092083865280 - 1 - DEBUG - 1-71: the poopsis headed to us towards the middle ofποies were very concrete so we had to sometime with some flying entering this iugpy
2026-11-21 19:05:05,900 - kalpy.graphs - 134092083865280 - 1 - DEBUG - 1-72: and when men finally shut down the mill of course the water in the brook below the mill would suddenly lower by quite a good amount
2026-11-21 19:05:05,900 - kalpy.graphs - 134092083865280 - 1 - DEBUG - 1-73: so then you could feed the fish in the book and with a pound spear on the end of a pole we could spear them
